                                                         analogue of lib/currencyFormat.ts.
currency / locale / precision (props)                 -> CurrencyInputProps.Currency / Culture / Precision (??2),
                                                         normalised (null culture -> CurrentCulture, precision 0..20).
display = formatCurrencyMicro(valueMicro,...)         -> CurrencyInputDisplay.FormattedValue (CurrencyMicro.Format;
                                                         null -> empty string).
symbol = currencySymbol(currency, locale)             -> CurrencyInputDisplay.Symbol (CurrencyMicro.Symbol).
icon span (text-[var(--text-muted)], aria-hidden,     -> leading muted TextBlock overlay inside the field, AccessibilityView.Raw,
  data-testid="currency-input-symbol"); input pl-10      AutomationId="currency-input-symbol", left-padding reserved for it.
local text buffer + free typing (setText)             -> CurrencyInputViewModel.Text + SetText (buffer only; no parse).
focusedRef guard + resync useEffect (!focused)        -> CurrencyInputViewModel.Focus/Blur + OnSourceChanged re-sync
                                                         gated on !IsFocused (in-progress text never clobbered).
commit on blur / Enter (parseCurrencyTextToMicro +    -> CurrencyInputViewModel.Blur / CommitFromEnter -> Commit():
  onChange({valueMicro}) + setText(reformatted))         CurrencyMicro.Parse -> ValueCommitted(CurrencyInputCommit) +
                                                         re-normalise buffer to the rounded display.
onChange callback                                     -> CurrencyInputViewModel.ValueCommitted event (re-exposed by the view).
ariaLabel (required prop)                             -> CurrencyInputProps.AriaLabel -> AutomationProperties.Name on the field
                                                         (blank -> i18n default).
label (passthrough InputProps)                        -> CurrencyInputProps.Label -> visible header above the field.
disabled / error (passthrough InputProps)             -> CurrencyInputProps.Disabled/HasError -> TsInput.IsEnabled / HasError.
@/components/ui Input                                 -> TeslaSync.App.Components.UI.TsInput (the native Input primitive).
