  'Electricity Cost (per kWh)')                          translation.settings.electricityCost (already in P1/S10 en/ar/he),
                                                         fallback "Electricity Cost (per kWh)".
component mount                                       -> CurrencyInputDiagnostics.RecordViewOpened() =>
                                                         "view.opened slug=CurrencyInput" (once, P1/S11).

--- STATES (web source is a pure presentational field — "Data sources: (none - pure presentational component)") ---
populated value  -> formatted currency string + leading symbol adornment                       [reproduced + tested]
empty value      -> blank editable area carrying ONLY the symbol affordance + the accessible    [reproduced + tested]
                    name (never a nameless blank box; valueMicro == null)
editing (focused) -> raw text buffer preserved verbatim; external re-sync suppressed             [reproduced + tested]
disabled         -> field non-interactive (web disabled)                                        [reproduced + tested]
error            -> error border + announced invalid (web error)                                [reproduced + tested]
loading / error(fetch) / stale / offline : DO NOT EXIST in the web source — it reads no network data (the prompt's own
  "Data sources" section says "(none - pure presentational component)"). Not stubbed, not invented; documented exactly
  like the sibling dataless presentational surfaces (Spinner 0140, AnimatedNumber, VisuallyHidden).

